<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts traded steady with Tuesday's close. Demand and Supply were moderate. Top $55.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    230-260 lbs    54.00-55.00</p>
<p>    US 1-2    210-220 lbs    51.00-54.00</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-230 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3    260-270 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
<p>		  270-280 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $56.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-500 lbs    41.00-44.00</p>
<p>		  over 500 lbs    52.00-56.00</p>
</text>
